  triage:deferredNote "Fix: introduce an enum for failure-reason categories and replace the raw string literals at producer/consumer sites. Routed to arch-ctm on BB6-FIX-RUNTIME-QA1-1789271000, branch fix/bb6-runtime-qa1 cut from 4b0f6661c. PR #1461, base feature/bb6-runtime-prompt-handoffs." ;
